cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you write about or build on OmniGet, please cite it as below."
title: OmniGet
abstract: >-
  A free, open source desktop app for Windows, macOS and Linux whose main part
  is a local MCP server that gives coding agents a desktop toolbox for
  downloads, media, files and chats. It is also a downloader built on yt-dlp
  and its own extractors.
type: software
authors:
